Tim Nunamaker: sort of CKTLS, and connecting the dots between somebody who wants

12
00:05:35.320 --> 00:05:42.109
Tim Nunamaker: you know, proof of providence, or whatever, and a regular person. Hey Anna. Hey, Justin.

13
00:05:42.330 --> 00:05:42.700
Anna Kazlauskas: Yay.

14
00:05:45.630 --> 00:05:49.980
Tim Nunamaker: I think we can just jump in. I don't know, Anna, if you wanted to…

15
00:05:50.210 --> 00:05:52.970
Tim Nunamaker: kick anything off here, I can just throw out the slides.

16
00:05:53.710 --> 00:05:58.139
Anna Kazlauskas: No, just excited for a second week. Good to see everybody, yeah.

17
